# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🎯 YOUR SPECIFIC ARTICLE SOURCES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# These are covered by the feeds above:
# ✅ Investors.com NVDA/PLTR articles → investors.com feeds
# ✅ CNBC tokenization article → Need CNBC scraper (Phase 2)
# ✅ PYMNTS articles → pymnts.com feed
# ✅ TechCrunch articles → techcrunch.com feeds
# ✅ MarketWatch articles → marketwatch.com feeds
# ✅ Reuters Wolfspeed bankruptcy → reuters.com business feed
# ✅ Reuters India tech news → reuters.com world feed

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🚀 QUICK START
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. Copy this entire file to your secrets.env
# 2. Or set these as Railway environment variables
# 3. Restart GHOST server
# 4. Visit /api/news to see aggregated feed
# 5. News will update every 5 minutes automatically

